<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Yabeng says North West talks not finished.</title>
<headline>Yabeng says North West talks not finished.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yabeng Investment Holding Co Ltd said on Wednesday that talks between the North West Development Corp Ltd and Bophirima Investment Holdings Ltd consortium were not yet concluded.</p>
<p>It was announced on June 18 that Bophirima would buy the North West's 40.2 percent stake in Yabeng for 153.7 million rand.</p>
<p>Yabeng also referred shareholders to a cautionary by Choice Holdings Ltd in which it said that it was in unspecified talks. Yabeng said the outcome of the talks may have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
